:: Deadwood Reblooms Love Interest Reactions [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-li-discovery'>>
  <<if $npc.length is 1 and ['Robin', 'Whitney', 'Alex', 'Eden'].includes($npc[0]) and $player.penisExist and $player.vaginaExist and !($deadwoodLiBodySeen || []).includes($npc[0])>>
    <<set $deadwoodLiBodySeen to $deadwoodLiBodySeen || []>>
    <<run $deadwoodLiBodySeen.pushUnique($npc[0])>>
    <<switch $npc[0]>>
      <<case 'Robin'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Robin blinks, then looks up at your face.
            <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 50>>
              "You could have told me," <<he>> says, a little pink around the ears. "It's still you."
            <<else>>
              "Oh. I didn't know," <<he>> murmurs. "Sorry. I didn't mean to stare."
            <</if>>
          <<option 'CN'>>
            罗宾眨了眨眼，随后抬头看向你的脸。
            <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 50>>
              “你可以告诉我的。”<<he>>说，耳根有些发红。“你还是你。”
            <<else>>
              “啊。我不知道……”<<he>>小声说，“对不起，我不是故意盯着看的。”
            <</if>>
        <</language>>
      <<case 'Whitney'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Whitney stares for a moment. "You have both?" <<He>> lets out a short laugh. "Keeping secrets from me, little <<girl>>?"
          <<option 'CN'>>
            惠特尼愣了一下。“你两个都有？”<<He>>短促地笑了一声。“还瞒着我呢，小<<girl>>？”
        <</language>>
      <<case 'Alex'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Alex raises <<his>> eyebrows. "Huh. Haven't seen that before." <<He>> glances back at your face. "Didn't mean to make a fuss."
          <<option 'CN'>>
            艾利克斯扬起眉毛。“嚯。以前没见过这样的。”<<He>>重新看向你的脸。“没想大惊小怪。”
        <</language>>
      <<case 'Eden'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Eden pauses, studying you. "So that's what you were hiding." <<He>> looks you in the eye. "You don't need to keep things from me."
          <<option 'CN'>>
            伊甸停了一下，打量着你。“原来你藏着这个。”<<He>>盯着你的眼睛。“不用对我藏着掖着。”
        <</language>>
    <</switch>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>
